[0.000, "o", "Edit the session scratchpad using       \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;40;50;40m \u001b[38;2;128;128;128mmultiple operations in a single call. Operations can be str_replace, insert, or overwrite         \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;40;50;40m \u001b[38;2;128;128;128mcommands and are applied in order. The scratchpad is working memory that persists when            \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;40;50;40m \u001b[38;2;128;128;128mconversation history is compacted or summarized.\u001b[39m                                                  \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;40;50;40m \u001b[38;2;128;128;128m   - Summarize the nature of changes (new feature, enhancement, bug fix, refactoring, test, docs)\u001b[39m \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;40;50;40m \u001b[38;2;128;128;128mOnce you are done with the task, you can summarize the changes you made in a 1-4 sentences, don't \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;40;50;40m \u001b[38;2;128;128;128mgo into too much detail.\u001b[39m                                                                          \u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[48;2;40;50;40m \u001b[38;2;128;128;128mOnce you are done with the task, you can summarize the changes you made i"]
