[0.000, "o", "                            \r\r\n \u001b[38;2;128;128;128m```\u001b[39m                                                                                               \r\r\n   \u001b[38;2;181;189;104mSummarize this segment of a coding session (segment 3 of 4).\u001b[39m                                    \r\r\n   \u001b[38;2;181;189;104m\u001b[39m                                                                                                \r\r\n   \u001b[38;2;181;189;104mFocus on:\u001b[39m                                                                                       \r\r\n   \u001b[38;2;181;189;104m- Evolution of requirements or approach\u001b[39m                                                         \r\r\n   \u001b[38;2;181;189;104m- Files modified and why\u001b[39m                                                                        \r\r\n   \u001b[38;2;181;189;104m- Errors encountered and resolutions\u001b[39m                                                            \r\r\n   \u001b[38;2;181;189;104m- Any user corrections or feedback\u001b[39m                                                  "]
[0.000, "o", "            \r\r\n   \u001b[38;2;181;189;104m\u001b[39m                                                                                                \r\r\n   \u001b[38;2;181;189;104mBudget: ~3000 tokens.\u001b[39m                                                                           \r\r\n \u001b[38;2;128;128;128m```\u001b[39m                                                                                               \r\r\n                                                                                                   \r\r\n                                                                                                   \r\r\n \u001b[1mFor the most recent slice (3):\u001b[22m                                                                    \r\r\n                                                                                                   \r\r\n \u001b[38;2;128;128;128m```\u001b[39m                                                                                               \r\r\n   \u001b[38;2;181;189;104mSummarize this segment of a coding session (segment 4 of 4 - MOST "]
